flowchart TD
    A[Student question] --> B[Classify: attendance / exams / fees / hostel / out of scope]
    B --> C{In supported scope?}
    C -- No --> D[Refuse and suggest relevant support]
    C -- Yes --> E[Retrieve relevant local policy sections]
    E --> F{Evidence present and non-conflicting?}
    F -- No --> G[Uncertainty or conflict response]
    F -- Yes --> H[Apply selected prompt version]
    H --> I{Gemini key configured?}
    I -- No --> J[Deterministic document lookup]
    I -- Yes --> K[Gemini structured JSON response]
    J --> L[Verify exact citation and quote]
    K --> L
    L --> M{Citation and answer verified?}
    M -- No --> G
    M -- Yes --> N[Answer + source + confidence]
